# Every sha256 the catalog records or checks (registry overlay digests, gate
# artifact hashes, typed-record inputs, save evidence) folds CRLF to LF before
# hashing (skills/scripts/data_formats.py content_sha256), so either line ending
# verifies. Keep text LF in the repository anyway so diffs stay clean.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.zip binary
*.skill binary
